{"id":"e98d69d59488c0ae","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-kreisel-shoenfield-basis.md","title":"非空有效闭类有严格低于 0′ 的成员","display":"thm-kreisel-shoenfield-basis — 非空有效闭类有严格低于 0′ 的成员","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-kreisel-shoenfield-basis","aliases":["20-thm-kreisel-shoenfield-basis"],"display":"thm-kreisel-shoenfield-basis — 非空有效闭类有严格低于 0′ 的成员","chapter":"9","section":"9.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 9.2.1","source_printed_pages":[176],"source_pdf_pages":[208],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-thm-effective-compactness]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-kreisel-shoenfield-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-kreisel-shoenfield-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kreisel-shoenfield-basis — 非空有效闭类有严格低于 0′ 的成员"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.2.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>208</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"49047c938f7aef20\" href=\"?note=49047c938f7aef20\" title=\"20-thm-effective-compactness\">20-thm-effective-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b222e27484042250\" href=\"?note=b222e27484042250\" title=\"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence\">20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 非空有效闭；将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,Y)\">\\((X,Y)\\)</span> 按偶、奇列编码为一个实。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"49047c938f7aef20\" href=\"?note=49047c938f7aef20\" title=\"20-thm-effective-compactness\">20-thm-effective-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b222e27484042250\" href=\"?note=b222e27484042250\" title=\"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence\">20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kreisel-shoenfield-basis}\\vdash\\exists X\\in C\\ [X&lt;_T\\varnothing&#39;].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kreisel-shoenfield-basis}\\vdash\\exists X\\in C\\ [X&lt;_T\\varnothing&#39;].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D=\\{X\\oplus Y:X\\in C\\land\\forall e\\ [\\Phi_e^X(e)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow Y(e)\\ne\\Phi_e^X(e)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D=\\{X\\oplus Y:X\\in C\\land\\forall e\\ [\\Phi_e^X(e)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow Y(e)\\ne\\Phi_e^X(e)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>失败由一个有限 oracle 停止以及一位相等见证，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 有效闭。给任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in C\">\\(X\\in C\\)</span>，在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 选择避开该停止值的二值位，即得某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 非空。有效紧致性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\oplus Y\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(X\\oplus Y\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(X\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\le_T X\">\\(Y\\le_T X\\)</span>，于是某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^X=Y\">\\(\\Phi_e^X=Y\\)</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 自相矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&lt;_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(X&lt;_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>二值选择面对输出非二值时任选一位即可；没有额外假定全部泛函二值。原书的配对类在这里明确编码为 Cantor 空间上的类。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 176 / PDF 208。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved