tage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"b222e27484042250","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kreisel-shoenfield-basis}\\vdash\\exists X\\in C\\ [X<_T\\varnothing'].","display":true},{"tex":"D=\\{X\\oplus Y:X\\in C\\land\\forall e\\ [\\Phi_e^X(e)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow Y(e)\\ne\\Phi_e^X(e)]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"X\\oplus Y\\le_T\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"X\\equiv_T\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\le_T X","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^X=Y","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"X<_T\\varnothing'","display":false}],"bytes":1832,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["b73290a0af01d44f","49047c938f7aef20","01d522a0b0df3738","08b4fd5163a7f955","b222e27484042250"]}